new_head "Guildmasters"
new_text "Gambit and I have been appointed guildmasters of the barbarians!Many new ideas will be implemented in order to bring this guild back to life.  By all means feel free to post ideas here, and above all,be patient with us, We will get the job done.Tatsuo / Gambit"
