tmp_text "Hi there,    I remember we still have a unfinish match!Barbarian always kick fighter's butt....I hope the guild stay as it is now.....no guild bar, teleportation nor guild room. We are just a barbarian! Weapon, armors are useless. We fight with our might! Barbariabbarbarianbarbariabbarbarian!**I  hate to disagree with you  Darkchilde, but were not doing so hot  thesedays. Maybe I'm  just a whiner, but when me friends in other guilds  aredoing massacres and pulps at 5th level with the mighty starburst,  and Imat 13th level  doing to very hards a round with the only weapon I can findsomething is a  little off. I dont want much, but a good weapon and a  placeto heal  a little faster would be nice.  Even mages can wield the saber-tooth(AD+D would never allow that) and were stuck with a  battle axe or stone clubI love this guild,  and I'll stand  by it  even if they take away all  mepowers, but that wont stop me from pushing for improvements.     Rinny Bellow!!!! *growl*     Still Upside down Rinny, barbarian  4  life.**Someoneactuallycleanedourboard!I'llkeepthisshort,causemyspacebardoesntwork.**this is about the devour commandwhen i was on the vamp quest i devoured a roomful of corpses but i only went up a very small margin...the other guilds are more capable of healing than thebarbs and i dont think its very fair if a lvl 25barbarian cannot kill something in one round thata mid level character can.  if our devour is betterthat may change things.  keep me posted...**Valder****Im back from my spring break.....if u need me just *bellow*    =)+Pace+**Yeah! Pace is back!!Me was wondering where you were.My spring break is coming upnext week.  Good to hear from you!**Valder****I was in Geneseo last week... Anton brought me to see ya but you werent around.....although there was some guy crashed out in your room *cough*......laters Vald..     +Pace+**hey paceso i heard that you came by...i was hoping i'd geta chance to meet you.  that was my roommate that was crashedout.  *grin*  well take care and i'll see you inthe mud world.  until next time!**Valder**Valder puts on a pin that says, \"Pace for Barbarian Guild Master!\"**	PACE FOR BARBARIAN GUILD MASTER!!!!!!!!**Me second the nomination of Pace for GM.     As if it even had to be said! :)    Rinny**Does melee work ?Not for me it doesn't**Ill third it.....yup, that pace.....hes so coolheh heherm...+Pace+**Well Pace, your first assignment as GM nominee is to see whymelee has stopped working. It says you lose your blah blah blah, andthen the next round it says you return to your sanity, even thoughall the monsters are still in the room. Help us Oh great one!    Rinny**Hello fellow brothers and sisters,this is your friendly barbarian valderjust telling you guys that i'm off to biggerand better things (spring break is finally here!!).take care of yourselves and don't do anythingi wouldn't do.  kick some butt and make me proud!!see you guys in a week or two :)			**Valder**p.s. try to fix melee by the time i get back :)**I asked uglymouth to take a look at melee. I don't have access to fix it.=)+Pace+**After a long vaction in the vagabonds guild in which I gained a measely 1 level i have returned to my beloved barbarians(vagabonds suck under level 10) I still think this guild kicks ass ... pfbc ... er prepare for barbariancombat is still as great as always Melee doesnt work ... you arent supposed to return to sanity until all the monsters are dead or you leave the room. I think it maybe be because of a delay in the start of combat , or the call to stop meleeis bugged or something. i was thinking about switching to mages, but now that I see this is still a great guild I might stay, if melee is fixed that is. Darkchilde ... how come you havent wizzed yet !!! I dont think we need a bar or teleport, but it would be nice if some wizzes would code some weapons which barbarians could use. Or make it so that such weapons can be availiable in the store I have wanted to try one of the spears from the native warriors inPaces area, but I dont think I can kill one and when they are soldthey are always hidden away. Pace how about Putting some heavy wooden clubs... of the orc kinds on the orang-utans ? In anycase ... we cant use weapons in barb combat or melee .. so we dont need one all the time.  *   *  * ** VEGA ** *  *   *  PS : I think Pacew would be an AWESOME GuildMaster, His area totally fits with the theme of our guild!!!! I just had a great Idea .... attach another area to this end of orc valley ! a barbarian theme area! of coarse anyone can play it but it would be special for us because it is close to our guild. i think it would be cool haveing players do the same mad dash throughorc valley that we do all the time. Plus it would attract players to this area , and more people would join our guild! **Hi....Sorry to give out on you guys...but well, it's time for me to moveon. I'am done with coding on here, so I will just be getting on to socialisenow and again. I'am not going to banish myself, so I can still come backif I ever feel like it. Iam very busy on another mud at the moment, onwhich I'am a trainee Arch-wiz =). Ive already done much more work on therethan I have in the year Ive been wiz here. It's an awesome mud, and it deservesmore of my time....if any of you ever want to check it out..warns.et.tudelft.nl 5317...you will see many familiar faces there....Thanks for makin my time here fun....stay cool!      +Pace+p.s Don't give up on the guild!**  WHAT'S UP???? MELEES BEEN DOWN FOR SEVERAL WEEKS!!!  WE ONLY HAVE TWO SPECIAL ATTACKS AND MELEE IS VERY VALUABLE  TO BARBARIANS!!!!!!  PLEASE FIX THIS ASAP.  **VALDER****As far as i am aware it is being looked at now by uglymouthand galadriel. I dont know when it will be fixed so please be patientand things will be ok.sorry valder......thats all i know :)texas**thanks a lot for looking into that Texas.The idea of putting a barbarian theme area aroundhere sounds really cool too.  too bad we dont havea gm though :(  thanks again Texas :)**Valder****Hi all,I think I have fixed the melee.If there still occur any probs,leave a note here, or mail me.See you around,			Viking Lord Uglymouth** Thank you very much for fixing melee. I appreciate it, especially because we only have 2 special attacks and each is so precious. -Warlord Valder-**Any o you barbs round for the summer? Just wonderin.                    Rinny.**Hi,After a long time of leaderlessness, you have a guildmasteragain: Airborne will take care of the guild from now on.			Viking Lord Uglymouth**    Hooray, for Airborne ! :) Now I can complain to him instead ofUglymouth ! :)    But it IS nice to have a GM. I hope we with less complaints now, butI doubt it :)                Goodluck Airborne.                      Luvs & Hugs,                                    Nipples.**To all my Barbarians:I want you all to get together and come up with a good time that we can all meet. You will find the time for the meeting as best you canand then you will pick your tribal leader at that campfire. I needto meet with you all and get some ideas as to what I have gottenmyself into.. and you all need to meet me as well.I will not get on your case after this point... you wanted someone tocare for your guild... and you have it... now its time for you guys(and gals) to put something into the organization of your own guild.Leave a note when you have selected a time to meet.Lord Airborne the Wild!**guess there is no hoard to call...*sigh*sad about thatkryll, simple yet fierce**Heya airborne.  I volunteer to be the hoard!!!!**IT'S MY BIRTHDAY!!!Nae**Apparently there is not hoard.Why not scrap the guild, make way for a new HUGE one.  Tatsuo**no offense to anyone, but i think this guild should be placed elsewherenow...ppl die when they try to get here, whether it be due tolag reasons or others...this is the only guild with rooms in frontof it that have powerful aggressive monsters and it wouldbe nice to actually have the guild have some players...kryll**does no one have a comment about my previous note ?!!!?kryll**I agree, but it is all up to the guild master.*peer at airborne*  ;)-Mangla**Just take the junk cargo to ezo island and go north...Its my new area..To get back to o holy mission island, go up to the junk cargowhen its at ezo island and type \"swim to junk\"Gambit**if you would like airborne,i will help here and give ideas for your guildglad to help and i have ideaskryll**Ideas are always welcome.However I am not inclined to make the guild more powerful. I think this is one of the only balanced guilds and I wouldn't mind keeping it as such.Airborne of the Barbarian Hoardes.**Greetings all.  I have some joyful news.  I have found a way for Tristan tovisit Daniella and their baby for Christmas.  I have gott≈